From b2d66f3904f69fb5ce04006a10b5f1a1c7d1c339 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 02:48:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign homepage for TaurusFit: dark-default theme, hero
 slider, brand colors

- Flip home/index.css tokens: red/blue TaurusFit accents replace olive,
  dark palette becomes the :root default with a [data-theme="light"]
  override (inverting the old light-default structure), Anton replaces
  Playfair/Fraunces for headlines.
- Fix footer.js's toggleTheme to explicitly set data-theme="light"
  instead of removing the attribute, so the light toggle still works
  now that :root is dark by default (footer.css has no
  [data-theme="light"] rules, so this is a no-op everywhere else).
- Replace the looping hero video with a 5-slide autoplaying image
  slider (crossfade, Ken Burns zoom, arrows, dots, swipe), consolidate
  the duplicated stat-counter IntersectionObserver into one.
- Add a scrolling ticker strip using the previously unused
  .marquee-bar/.marquee-track CSS.
- Add cut-corner clip-path to product cards to match the angular
  language already used elsewhere on the page.
- Rewrite all EN/FR/AR copy in home/index.js and the static fallback
  text in home/index.html from carpet/Maison Comfort content to
  TaurusFit CrossFit/gym copy.
- Bump index.css to v33 and index.js to v25.
